{"t":"NRG","made":"2026-11-11 00:34","name":"NRG Energy, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Independent Power Producers","employees":16702,"hq":"Houston, TX, United States","website":"https://www.nrg.com","summary_en":"NRG Energy, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as an energy and home services company in the United States and Canada. It operates through the Texas, East, West/Other, Vivint Smart Home, and Corporate Activities segments. The company offers retail electricity, energy management, demand response and virtual power plant programs, carbon offsets, smart home security, and automation services. It also offers system power, distributed and backup generation, energy storage, energy management, renewable and low-carbon products, and carbon management solutions for large business and commercial customers; a cloud-based home platform, including hardware, software, sales, installation, customer service, technical support, and professional monitoring solutions; and generation portfolio includes fossil fuel and renewable generation assets diversified by fuel type and dispatch level, with ongoing development of new natural gas and renewable projects. In addition, the company trades in power, natural gas, and related products; environmental products; weather products; and financial products, including forwards, futures, options, and swaps. It offers its products and services under the NRG, Reliant, Direct Energy, Green Mountain Energy, and Vivint. It serves residential, commercial, government, industrial, data center, and wholesale customers. NRG Energy, Inc. was founded in 1989 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"NRG Energy, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미국과 캐나다에서 에너지 및 홈 서비스 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 텍사스, 동부, 서부/기타, Vivint Smart Home 및 기업 활동 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 소매 전기, 에너지 관리, 수요 대응 및 가상 발전소 프로그램, 탄소 상쇄, 스마트 홈 보안 및 자동화 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 대기업 및 상업 고객을 위한 시스템 전력, 분산 및 백업 발전, 에너지 저장, 에너지 관리, 재생 가능 및 저탄소 제품, 탄소 관리 솔루션을 제공합니다. 하드웨어, 소프트웨어, 판매, 설치, 고객 서비스, 기술 지원 및 전문 모니터링 솔루션을 포함한 클라우드 기반 홈 플랫폼; 발전 포트폴리오에는 새로운 천연 가스 및 재생 가능 프로젝트의 지속적인 개발과 함께 연료 유형 및 급전 수준에 따라 다양화된 화석 연료 및 재생 가능 발전 자산이 포함됩니다. 또한 회사는 전력, 천연가스 및 관련 제품을 거래합니다. 환경제품; 날씨 상품; 선도, 선물, 옵션 및 스왑을 포함한 금융 상품. NRG, Reliant, Direct Energy, Green Mountain Energy 및 Vivint라는 이름으로 제품과 서비스를 제공합니다. 주거용, 상업용, 정부, 산업, 데이터 센터 및 도매 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. NRG Energy, Inc.는 1989년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 휴스턴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":96.385,"mcap":20239204352.0,"pe":16.850525,"fpe":9.604347,"peg":0.3024,"ps":0.5789908,"pb":4.3789473,"ev_ebitda":10.737,"div":1.95,"beta":1.201,"hi52":189.96,"lo52":79.65},"fin":{"rev":34956001280.0,"rev_g":0.24,"eps_g":2.754,"gross":0.20197001,"op":0.1161,"net":0.03599,"roe":0.34742,"fcf":1378625024.0,"cash":148000000.0,"debt":23129999360.0,"de":438.733,"eps":5.72,"feps":10.03556},"own":{"short":0.0381,"inst":0.95671,"insider":0.04457},"analyst":{"n":17,"mean":165.70589,"median":165.0,"high":221.0,"low":104.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.41176,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":12,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":12,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":10,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":10,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"CIBC","ToGrade":"Outperformer","FromGrade":"Outperformer","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":159.0,"priorPriceTarget":173.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"Scotiabank","ToGrade":"Sector Outperform","FromGrade":"Sector Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":149.0,"priorPriceTarget":162.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":182.0,"priorPriceTarget":209.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-27","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overw